        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Funds raised from selling this game will be spent on saving lives of our little friends.</strong>  <br><i>Every cat found in-game contributes to helping a real one in need.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find Meow in Dwarf Mines</strong> is a cozy hidden object game where you explore hand-drawn Dwarf Mines to find <strong>100 charming cats</strong>, each one carefully hidden and full of personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax, explore at your own pace, and enjoy a peaceful journey filled with lovely meows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐱 <strong>100 unique cats</strong> to find — each one hand-placed with love</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Custom color painting</strong> — choose your favorite color to mark found cats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 <strong>Relaxing soundtrack</strong> — gentle background music to accompany your exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Large hand-drawn map</strong> — explore every corner to uncover all hidden cats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💡 <strong>Hint system</strong> — a hint button appears once you find 90 cats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Achievements support</strong> — track your progress and unlock Steam achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💾 <strong>Progress saving</strong> — continue your journey anytime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔁 <strong>Replay-friendly</strong> — reset and enjoy again anytime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖱️ <strong>Simple point-and-click controls</strong> — intuitive and accessible for everyone</p>",
